# eval/compare_generators.py's raw output — full prompts/chunk text
# (contexts), per-case answers (results), and the resumable progress file
# all regenerable via capture_generation_contexts.py + compare_generators.py.
# generator_ab_report.md (the small aggregates-only Markdown summary) is
# NOT listed here — that one is committed.
eval/**/generator_ab_contexts.json
eval/**/generator_ab_results.json
eval/**/generator_ab_progress.json
# Same for the post-fix (golden v3) re-run and the title-free-scoped
# variant — generator_ab_postfix_v3_report.md / analyze_postfix_ab_
# report.json are committed (small aggregates), raw contexts/results/
# progress/per-row analysis are not.
eval/**/generator_ab_postfix_v3_contexts.json
eval/**/generator_ab_postfix_v3_results.json
eval/**/generator_ab_postfix_v3_progress.json
eval/**/generator_ab_postfix_v3_titlefreescoped_contexts.json
eval/**/generator_ab_postfix_v3_titlefreescoped_results.json
eval/**/generator_ab_postfix_v3_titlefreescoped_progress.json
eval/**/analyze_postfix_ab_report.json
eval/**/analyze_postfix_ab_titlefreescoped_report.json
# cross_run_factor_analysis.py's raw per-case output and prepare_blind_
# adjudication.py's large anonymized presentation file — both
# regenerable from already-committed results/golden files.
# blind_adjudication_verdicts.json (the actual human judgments),
# blind_adjudication_titlefreescoped_KEY.json (needed to reproduce the
# join), and blind_adjudication_report.json (small final aggregate) ARE
# committed — they're the non-regenerable record.
eval/**/cross_run_factor_analysis_report.json
eval/**/blind_adjudication_titlefreescoped.json
# build_caption_label_index.py / analyze_caption_misses.py's raw output —
# both regenerable from a live instance; the findings/table are written up
# in eval/mixed_corpus/README.md's "Full taxonomy" section.
eval/**/caption_label_index.json
eval/**/caption_miss_taxonomy.json
# title_free_retrieval_check.py's raw output — regenerable from a live
# instance; the summary numbers are written up in eval/mixed_corpus/
# README.md's title-free robustness section.
eval/**/title_free_retrieval_check*.json
# rescore_against_v3.py's raw per-row output — regenerable from the
# already-committed generator_ab_results.json + golden_dataset_v3.json;
# the summary table is in eval/mixed_corpus/README.md's "Golden-dataset
# v3" section.
eval/**/rescore_v3_report.json
